dashboard.definition:
{
  "title": "Custom Icon Images",
  "description": "Maps+ example: custom icon images.",
  "dataSources": {
    "ds_map": {
      "type": "ds.search",
      "name": "Map rows",
      "options": {
        "query": "| inputlookup chicago-crime.csv | eval customIcon=\"kovar.png\", markerSize=\"40,40\", layerDescription=\"The Kovar\", layerIconSize=\"30,30\"",
        "queryParameters": {
          "earliest": "-24h@h",
          "latest": "now"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "visualizations": {
    "viz_intro": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "Use custom images as icons. Include the images in `$SPLUNK_HOME/etc/apps/leaflet_maps_app/appserver/static/visualizations/maps-plus/contrib/images`\n\nSet the `customIcon` field to the name of the image. Adjust the size of the marker using the [`markerSize`](https://github.com/sghaskell/maps-plus#markersize) field."
      }
    },
    "viz_map": {
      "type": "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus",
      "title": "Custom icon image marker",
      "dataSources": {
        "primary": "ds_map"
      },
      "options": {
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.allPopups": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.animate": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.autoFitAndZoom": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.autoFitAndZoomDelay": "500",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.bingMaps": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.bingMapsLabelLanguage": "en-US",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.bingMapsTileLayer": "CanvasLight",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.cluster": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.contextMenu": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.criticalThreshold": "80",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.defaultHeight": "600",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.disableClusteringAtZoom": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.drilldown": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.drilldownAction": "dblclick",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.fullScreen": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.googlePlacesPosition": "topleft",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.googlePlacesSearch": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.googlePlacesZoomLevel": "12",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapBlur": "15",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapColorGradient": "{\"0.4\":\"blue\",\"0.6\":\"cyan\",\"0.7\":\"lime\",\"0.8\":\"yellow\",\"1\":\"red\"}",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapEnable": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapMaxPointIntensity": "1.0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapMinOpacity": "1.0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapOnly": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapRadius": "25",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.i18nLanguage": "en",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.layerControl": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.layerControlCollapsed": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.mapCenterLat": "41.880889",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.mapCenterLon": "-87.72819",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.mapCenterZoom": "16",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.mapTile": "http://{s}.basemaps.cartocdn.com/light_all/{z}/{x}/{y}.png",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.maxClusterRadius": "80",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.maxSpiderfySize": "100",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.maxZoom": "19",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureActiveColor": "#00ff00",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureCompletedColor": "#0066ff",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureIconPosition": "topright",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureLocalization": "en",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measurePrimaryAreaUnit": "acres",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measurePrimaryLengthUnit": "feet",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureSecondaryAreaUnit": "sqmiles",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureSecondaryLengthUnit": "miles",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureTool": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.minZoom": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.multiplePopups": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.pathColorList": "#0003F0,#D43C29,darkgreen,0xe2d400,darkred,#23A378",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.pathRenderer": "svg",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.pathSplitInterval": "60",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.pathSplits": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.permanentTooltip": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeOneBgColor": "#B5E28C",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeOneFgColor": "#6ECC39",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeThreeBgColor": "#FD9C73",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeThreeFgColor": "#F18017",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeTwoBgColor": "#F1D357",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeTwoFgColor": "#F0C20C",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.refreshInterval": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.scrollWheelZoom": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.showPathLines": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.showProgress": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.singleMarkerMode": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.spiderfyDistanceMultiplier": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.stickyTooltip": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.warningThreshold": "55",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.useOpenFreeMap": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.maplibreStylePreset": "positron"
      }
    },
    "viz_teach": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "## What this shows\nEvery row from the Chicago crime lookup drawn with one **custom image** (`kovar.png`) as the marker icon instead of a pin.\n\n## The SPL\n```spl\n| inputlookup chicago-crime.csv | eval customIcon=\"kovar.png\", markerSize=\"40,40\", layerDescription=\"The Kovar\", layerIconSize=\"30,30\"\n```\n\n## How it works\n1. `inputlookup chicago-crime.csv` loads rows that already carry `latitude` and `longitude`.\n2. `eval customIcon=\"kovar.png\"` names the image file. Setting `customIcon` forces `markerType` to `custom`.\n3. `markerSize=\"40,40\"` sizes the image; `layerDescription` and `layerIconSize` label the layer-control entry and size its small icon.\n4. No `| table`: all lookup columns pass through, and fields Maps+ does not know are ignored for drawing.\n\n## Field formats and rules\n| Field | Expected format | Rule / gotcha |\n|---|---|---|\n| `latitude` | decimal degrees, numeric (e.g. `41.88`) | Exact lowercase name, required on marker rows. Only the first row is checked; if it has no `latitude`+`longitude` the panel shows an error. |\n| `longitude` | decimal degrees, numeric (e.g. `-87.72`) | Exact lowercase name. Longitude is negative west of Greenwich. Rows at 0,0 usually mean missing coordinates. |\n| `customIcon` | image file name, e.g. `kovar.png` | File must exist in `leaflet_maps_app/appserver/static/visualizations/maps-plus/contrib/images/`. Forces `markerType=custom`. |\n| `markerSize` | `\"w,h\"` pixels | String with width first, here `\"40,40\"`. |\n| `layerDescription` | HTML string | Label in the layer control. |\n| `layerIconSize` | `\"w,h\"` pixels | Size of the icon beside the label in the layer control (default `20,20`). |\n\n## Try it\n- Change `markerSize` to `\"60,60\"` for a bigger image.\n- Add `description=\"<b>Hello</b>\"` to the `eval` to get a click popup.\n\nStudio note: on Maps+ 4.6.9 and earlier `customIcon` is broken in Dashboard Studio (the image URL is built from `location.origin`, which is `null` inside the Studio frame), so markers may show a broken image there. It works in classic dashboards, and a fix is on the unreleased 4.6.10 branch. The conversion is kept faithful; use `svg` or `circle` markers if you need Studio today. the original `mapTile` (a CARTO URL) is kept, but this Studio version turns on keyless OpenFreeMap (`useOpenFreeMap` = 1), because CARTO tiles show an \"API KEY REQUIRED\" watermark without a key.\n\n**Basemap:** this example uses keyless OpenFreeMap vector tiles (`useOpenFreeMap` = 1). CARTO basemaps need a free API key: see **Help > Basemaps & API keys** for how to get one and where to put it (**Map Tile Override**)."
      }
    }
  },
  "layout": {
    "tabs": {
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "New tab",
          "layoutId": "layout_1"
        }
      ]
    },
    "layoutDefinitions": {
      "layout_1": {
        "type": "absolute",
        "options": {
          "width": 1440,
          "height": 910,
          "display": "auto"
        },
        "structure": [
          {
            "item": "viz_intro",
            "type": "block",
            "position": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "w": 1440,
              "h": 150
            }
          },
          {
            "item": "viz_map",
            "type": "block",
            "position": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 150,
              "w": 880,
              "h": 760
            }
          },
          {
            "item": "viz_teach",
            "type": "block",
            "position": {
              "x": 880,
              "y": 150,
              "w": 560,
              "h": 760
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
